{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(今なぁちゃんから貰った化粧水つけてるとこ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国ツアーの広島公演が自分の中で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり すっごい大きいもので..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだあのステージの感覚が体から離れません"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国ツアーで広島は初公演で\n自分の地元ということもあって、かける思いがやっぱり強くて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場には私の名前が入ったタオルに団扇などたくさんのグッツを見つけて...声援も聞こえたよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんと、まあやの地元での初LIVEという事もあって、遠くからも観に来てくれた方も居てくださったり‥‥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体調を崩してるメンバーも何人か居て‥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんも心配だったけど復活して、メンバー全員が揃って良かった♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてお花もたくさん送ってくれて...すっごく大きいのとか、手のこったものなどもあって感動しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんも喜んでて、お花の前で お兄ちゃん達が写真撮って送ってきてくれました。 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族も観に来てくれてて..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の親はとても心配症なので、このライブで\nいい姿が見せれたらな♪って\n安心してくれたらなっ♪って\n東京に1人送り出してよかった！って思ってもらえたらいいなぁっていう思いも自分の中であって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなたくさんの思いが詰まったライブでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泣かないと思ってたのにだんだん思いが溢れてきたなぁ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泣きたくはなかったけど、皆が優しいし 涙が我慢できなかったよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆が居てくれたから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっごく素敵な感動の夏の思い出ができました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ福岡に大阪 東京と続くので毎日ドタバタとぐぐぐぅぅぅんっと過ごしていきまぁす"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさみさと かわごちゃんの地元～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみ待っててね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(リハではツアーTシャツでしてるの♪これは仙台のTシャツかな？꒰⑅•ᴗ•⑅꒱)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやはライブ直前は絶対に２曲テンションの上がる曲を聞いてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、オーバーチュアが流れてるときはメンバー同士で思い切り背中を叩いて気合を入れます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてまあや叩いてもらったあと軽くジャンプして自分の体をバシバシ叩いてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それをしてステージ出てる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかそれしなくてもいけるんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それしていつもステージ上がってたから、それしないとなんか違うなぁってなる気がしていつもしてるの..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねぇねぇちなみに気づいたことある？このブログで！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねぇわかる？わかるよね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう！髪がまた短くなったの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ね？うん。気づかないかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"切ったんだぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして昨日はゴルフの収録してきたよ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっごく太陽が暑くて日焼けどめきいてないとおもう...ﾁ───(´-ω-｀)───ﾝ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎回ゲストの芸人さんが面白くて現場はとっても楽しいで～すっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてまいやんまなつおめでとう♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに今日もまいやんから貰った服を着てます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやの家にはまいやかんからの貰い物も沢山あって    いつもありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにまなつから貰ったメイク道具使ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあや  ほんとメンバーからの貰い物多いなぁ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも今度まいやん家行くっていって行けてないから今度行くからねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなつはまあやの家にご飯作りに来てくれるって前言ってくれたから待ってるね笑笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人ともほんとにおめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしくねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"birthdayの二人との写真は755orモバイルメールの方で送るね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0026.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして来週の乃木坂工事中はなんと和田まあやのフィーチャー会ですよ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0027.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0027.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0027.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0027.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和田まあやは本当にただのおバカではない事がこのＴＶを見たらわかります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなのまあやのイメージきっとかわるかもぉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(･∀･)ﾆﾔﾆﾔ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてなんとなんと！\nとってもお忙しい中あのすっごいすっごい素敵なゲストさんと収録しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひお見逃しなく～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがたい事に毎日お仕事させてもらってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日もお仕事頑張りまぁす"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆の明日が健康で笑顔でありますように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/20/5249661/0029.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}